            ["en"] = L(
                D("Enter the front/back brand, identity, contact details, and public URL.", "Refresh the QR, test the mobile landing page, then export SVG, HTML, or vCard.", "Sign in to save versions and restore more than one card across sessions.", "Two-sided editor", "Control typography, sizing, accent color, and back images for each side.", "QR and vCard", "Open one public profile and let visitors save a contact file from its QR.", "Exports and history", "Produce print SVG, landing HTML, and account-backed card versions.", "Can I edit a card after creating its QR?", "Yes while the public URL stays the same. Regenerate the QR when the URL name changes.", "Can I create a card without signing in?", "Yes, but guest work remains in this browser. Sign in for history and cross-device access."),
                D("Sign in and create an invitation with a URL, couple name, date, and admin password.", "Add ceremony details, photos, video, music, maps, accounts, and guestbook content in Admin.", "Review layout, visibility, search, and OG preview settings before sharing the link.", "Invitation editor", "Manage basic details, section order, themes, and mobile copy in one workspace.", "Media and maps", "Publish galleries, video, background music, venue coordinates, and map-app links.", "Sharing and operations", "Configure guestbook, account info, search visibility, OG, and ThankYou linking.", "Where do I edit an existing invitation?", "Use My invitations after sign-in, or enter the admin password at /your-slug/admin.", "Does the guest language automatically follow my admin language?", "No. Admin UI language and public content are separate; save guest-facing copy in the intended language."),
                D("Connect a Wedding invitation or create a standalone ThankYou address.", "Add a thank-you message, photos, optional account/contact details, and visibility.", "Review the share title, description, and image before sending the link.", "Thank-you story", "Present post-event gratitude and memories on a mobile-first page.", "Photos and contacts", "Optionally share selected images and useful account or contact details.", "Standalone link and OG", "Use a separate URL with its own messenger/social preview.", "Can I use ThankYou without Wedding?", "Yes. It works independently and can also be linked from an existing invitation.", "Must it reuse the invitation photos?", "No. You can reuse them or upload ThankYou-specific photos and an OG image."),
                D("Create a family album and choose its basic privacy and discovery settings.", "Invite family members, then add photos, video, and stories to the timeline.", "Review member permissions and the cleanup policy for unused new albums.", "Private timeline", "Keep family records in chronological order and away from ordinary search results.", "Family invitations", "Collaborate through invitation links and member permissions.", "Photos and stories", "Browse media, comments, and family stories together.", "Will a family album appear in search engines?", "It is private and excluded by default; confirm the sharing scope in album settings.", "Are empty albums kept forever?", "An album with no first post within the stated period may be cleaned up to prevent abuse."),
                D("Install the CCTV agent on the Windows PC connected to the cameras.", "Register RTSP addresses and names, then confirm each HLS conversion status.", "Open the browser viewer and verify channels plus public/admin links.", "RTSP to HLS", "Relay camera streams in a browser-compatible HLS format.", "Multi-camera view", "Switch among registered channels and inspect their health in one place.", "Remote viewing", "Use permission-aware links from desktop and mobile browsers.", "Can a browser open the camera without the agent?", "No. The agent must be running on the Windows PC that can reach the camera.", "Why is there a short delay?", "HLS conversion and network buffering add latency; agent and network health also matter."),
                D("Review each product or development service, price, and delivery conditions.", "Confirm the cart and order information, then continue to payment or consultation.", "Track fulfillment or delivery in order history and contact support when needed.", "Direct offerings", "Browse goods and scoped development services provided directly by CodeMaru.", "Order management", "Follow cart, order, shipping, cancellation, and refund information.", "Shared account", "Keep purchases and support conversations under your CodeMaru login.", "Who sells and operates the listings?", "Each detail page identifies the provider and terms, including CodeMaru-direct items.", "Can custom development be purchased immediately?", "Fixed-scope items can be ordered; custom work begins after requirements and quotation review."),
                D("Sign in and complete your profile, stack, experience, and external links.", "Add each project's role, results, media, repository, and live service links.", "Set visibility and OG metadata, preview the profile, then share its address.", "Project case studies", "Describe responsibilities, measurable outcomes, and production operations by project.", "Media and links", "Combine cover images, video, GitHub, and live service links.", "Public profile", "Control visibility, search metadata, and link previews from one address.", "Must every project be public?", "No. Keep drafts hidden and publish only the projects you choose.", "What image sizes work best?", "Use square list thumbnails, 1200×630px share images, and wide originals for banners."),
                D("Install the Dreamine.MVVM NuGet packages required by your application.", "Build ViewModels with properties, commands, source generators, Locator, and DI.", "Bind the same ViewModel flow to WPF, Blazor, or Hybrid UI and review samples/API docs.", "MVVM Core and Generators", "Generate observable state, commands, and repetitive glue at compile time.", "Locator and DI", "Inject ViewModels and services with less platform coupling.", "WPF and Blazor Hybrid", "Share domain and ViewModel flows between desktop and web UI.", "Is Dreamine a visual page builder?", "No. It is a developer framework for MVVM structure, generators, DI, and WPF/Blazor integration.", "Which package should I install first?", "Start with Dreamine.MVVM.Core; add Generators, Locators, and Hybrid.Wpf for those capabilities.")),

            ["ja"] = L(
                D("表裏のブランド、氏名、連絡先、公開URLを入力します。", "QRを更新し、公開ページを確認してSVG・HTML・vCardを出力します。", "ログインして複数の名刺とバージョンを履歴に保存します。", "両面編集", "文字、サイズ、色、背景を面ごとに調整します。", "QR・vCard", "QRからプロフィールを開き連絡先を保存できます。", "出力・履歴", "印刷SVG、HTML、ログイン履歴を提供します。", "QR作成後も編集できますか？", "同じ公開URLなら更新されます。URL名を変えた場合はQRも再生成してください。", "未ログインでも作れますか？", "作成できますがゲスト作業は現在のブラウザーだけに残ります。"),
                D("ログイン後、URL、二人の名前、挙式日、管理パスワードで招待状を作ります。", "管理画面で写真・動画・音楽・地図・案内・口座・芳名帳を設定します。", "レイアウト、公開範囲、検索、OGを確認して共有します。", "招待状編集", "基本情報、セクション順、テーマを一元管理します。", "メディア・地図", "写真、動画、BGM、会場座標と地図リンクを掲載します。", "共有・運用", "芳名帳、口座、検索、OG、ThankYou連携を設定します。", "既存の招待状はどこで編集しますか？", "ログイン後の一覧、または /招待状URL/admin で管理パスワードを入力します。", "管理画面の言語が招待状にも反映されますか？", "管理UIと公開文面は別です。ゲスト向け文面は希望言語で保存してください。"),
                D("Weddingと連携するか、独立したThankYou URLを作ります。", "お礼、写真、任意の口座・連絡先と公開範囲を入力します。", "共有タイトル、説明、画像を確認して送ります。", "お礼メッセージ", "挙式後の感謝と思い出をモバイルページにまとめます。", "写真・連絡先", "必要な写真と口座・連絡先を選んで共有します。", "独立URL・OG", "専用URLとメッセンジャー用プレビューを持てます。", "Weddingなしでも使えますか？", "はい。単独で作成でき、既存の招待状にも連携できます。", "招待状の写真を使う必要がありますか？", "いいえ。再利用も専用写真・OG画像の登録も可能です。"),
